1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,976
Eddie, Sammy, and Lulu want to visit Maya.

3
00:00:08,976 --> 00:00:10,571
Oh no!

4
00:00:10,571 --> 00:00:13,670
Two houses look the same color.

5
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:16,382
They knock on the wrong door.

6
00:00:16,382 --> 00:00:19,002
Mapi is the town map.

7
00:00:19,002 --> 00:00:21,715
She gives each house a name.

8
00:00:21,715 --> 00:00:23,442
A star.

9
00:00:23,442 --> 00:00:24,985
A moon.

10
00:00:24,985 --> 00:00:26,901
Not the color.

11
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,537
The name!

12
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:30,877
She points by name.

13
00:00:30,877 --> 00:00:33,085
This way to Maya.

14
00:00:33,085 --> 00:00:34,680
Oh no!

15
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,406
Maya's house is closed.

16
00:00:37,406 --> 00:00:40,505
Mapi points to the open twin.

17
00:00:40,505 --> 00:00:42,845
That is failover.

18
00:00:42,845 --> 00:00:46,170
All three friends at the right door.

19
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:48,151
Maya waves.

20
00:00:48,151 --> 00:00:50,571
Now you know Mapi!

21
00:00:50,571 --> 00:00:55,265
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

